label c3end:
    play sound "sounds/pick.wav" noloop
    menu (bad_end=True):
        with dissolve
        "退到一旁，等这些日子过去。":
            jump forsakenrelay
        "试着改变过去。":
            $ StopMusic(fadeout=2)
            $ Pause(2.0)
            jump c3continue
label forsakenrelay:
    $ SceneTitle("蜃景")
    $ UnlockNote("c3_011", 1)
    $ Pause(1.3)
    scene bg cg1-4
    with slowdissolve
    $ StopMusic(fadeout=1.5)
    $ Pause(3.5)
    #play music "<loop 25.949>music/gateway.ogg" fadein 5
    $ PlayMusic("gateway", fadein=5)
    $ Pause(2.0)
    show bg black
    $ Snow(0, fast=True)
    with slowdissolve
    $ Pause(0.5)
    if not persistent.forsaken:
        c "……"
        #akaro a can't follow her anymore so she isn't the mountains after noticing someone followed her
        c "那就是答案。她没有对自己失望，也没有为即将到来的一切感到悲伤。……知道自己已经做出了决定，Shiroya 反倒松了口气。"
        c "她不知道接下来会发生什么。芦屋塔会被封锁整整一个月吗？若真如此，就很难指望储藏室的门能把剩下的人放出来了。"
        c "这意味着，她还有几天属于自己的时间。之后会变成什么样，Shiroya 无从知晓，但她相信自己和 Atsuki 能撑过去。她的目标只是好好享受剩下的时光。{w}然而，下山途中望着熙熙攘攘的街道，她心里却只觉得空落落的。"
        #have shiroya remember that before traveling akaro was also in the entrance with the others
        c "……"
        c "至少，那只是假想中会发生的情形。然而，事情偏偏没有那样发展。"
        $ Pause(0.3)
        show bg cell
        with slowdissolve
        c "准确说来，她此刻身处的环境与山间没有半点相似之处。"
        nvl clear
        with dissolve
        #in this end the recording would never exist because they'd never wake up in the future, imply it's not found in isla's bag
        #the case of this bad ending is really unfortunate because its concept came up when i thought years ago "if ascended shiroya isn't in the end of c1 then atsuki will not be stopped from unplugging the cabinet and he'll touch the sekimeiya." however at this point that doesnt make any sense because MANY more changes would come with the disappearance of ascended shiroya, so it wouldn't be as simple as that, and right now im simply converging it with what happened in c1 without giving much of a reason
        #like, i wanted to do "what would happen if in the future shiroya never stopped the travels forward from occurring," but that doesn't make sense because if the travels were stopped they'd never happen to begin with (the same way they did.) so i dont' know. there are many things that don't make sense in this ending if the events aren't thoroughly explained, for example shiroya touching the sekimeiya at the end of the 12 hours when in this case atsuki couldn't have told her that the past can be changed since they wouldnt have gone to C (definitely not in the same way)
        c "四周幽暗而诡异。她从来没跟离自己最近的那个人说过话。"
        c "为什么……？"
        c "这个世界并没有被冻结，而是为了方便、让人感到熟悉而做了改动。通常来说，这种形态不太可能被构造出来，但为了强调某些方面，它又是必要的。"
        c "……Shiroya 现在在哪里？她又是怎么到那儿的？"
        $ Pause(0.5)
        nvl clear
        with dissolve
        $ Pause(0.7)
        show bg black
        with dissolve
        $ Pause(0.5)
    else:
        $ Pause(1.5)
    show bg tunnel
    show shiroyal clean 4a sad dark
    with dissolve
    $ Pause(0.4)
    c "Shiroya 穿越了十五天的时间，最后发现自己身处地下。"
    c "她最终的决定，是不去尝试改变历史，从此再也不踏进芦屋塔。当然，此时的她还不知道这一点。"
    show bg cg1
    hide shiroyal
    with dissolve
    c "走出那条倾斜的隧道后，丰花全城尽收眼底，太阳早已落到地平线之下。"
    #shiroya still should imply atsuki wanted to change the past at the end so that its justified that he touched the f sekimeiya
    #also say later on maxi and umi are at shiroya's apartment
    show bg night5
    with dissolve
    c "她在昏暗的街道上漫无目的地走着，来到那家发生爆炸的店铺前。她心力交瘁，也始终不知道究竟发生了什么，就这样走回了自己的公寓。"
    #itd be funny if in this ending she touches the P Sekimeiya instead, but probably too misleading, and itd be a concept too similar to the first bad end in c2
    $ Pause(0.5)
    show bg bedroomnight1
    with dissolve
    c "几分钟前她还在塔里，谈论着再一次使用 Sekimeiya，指望过去真的能够改变。可一回到家，她便匆匆扑到床上，就穿着那身许久以前被打湿的衣服躺下了。"
    nvl clear
    with dissolve
    $ Pause(0.5)
    show bg c3entrance
